1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
What can you do in sixty seconds?

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
One arena. Sixty seconds.
Nothing but skill.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Collect the shards. Chain the combo.
Dodge everything else.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Everyone gets the same arena — so when
your friend beats you… you know it's fair.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,500
One more?

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:29,000
And we're planning Campus Clash: qualifiers,
brackets and finals for your school or college.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
ONE MORE. It's in development —
request early access and help us test it.
